s on a pirate drum kit made of barrels and brass cymbals. Then the drums sink away, your sticks turn into two cutlasses and a wooden conveyor brings everything to the beat: treasure chests full of coins, long crates you rip open, chains, cannonballs, barrels, ropes, bottles, maps and gems.\n\n- Drums, swords and fists: play the drums, slice to the beat, then punch down 5 meter brick walls with steel fists\n- Cut pirates, the arms of the Kraken and the fragments of cannon shots\n- 7 arenas in 360 degrees: Turquoise Bay, Sun Fortress, Ghost Fleet, Volcano Island, Ice Corsairs, Treasure Grotto and the Kraken Storm\n- 7 original pirate songs\n- Standing or seated mode, 3 difficulty levels, coins and gems to collect\n- Don't slice the skull bombs!\n\nHoist the sails and play to the rhythm of the seas!", "short_description": "A pirate rhythm adventure in VR: play the barrel drums, slice treasure chests and cannonballs with two cutlasses, cut the Kraken's arms and smash brick walls with giant steel fists."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://brojekgames.com/privacidade.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "BROJEK", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://brojekgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["pt_BR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1372659812601145"}}]}, 